{"hw":"πάλα","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πάλα</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πάλα</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">nugget</b> of gold, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.2.8</span> </span>. (Spanish word.) </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">πάλα: ζώνη</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div></div>"}